{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测macOS尝试启用root账号。对应需求：持久化。官方：Attempt to Enable the Root Account。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-endpoint.events.*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS尝试启用root账号","references":["https://ss64.com/osx/dsenableroot.html"],"risk_score":47,"rule_id":"cc2fd2d0-ba3a-4939-b87f-2901764ed036","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"medium","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 持久化","来源: 默认","对应需求: 持久化"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"process where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type in (\"start\", \"process_started\") and\n process.name == \"dsenableroot\" and \n not process.args == \"-d\"\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS尝试启用root账号\n\n### 为何重要\n在重启或登录后保持立足点\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"endpoint","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.